      <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
        <name>InformationDecoration1</name>
        <id>202</id>
        <title>
          <key>en</key>
          <value>During migration, the following operations are not recommended:
- Changing settings of contact details kinds for partners and warehouses.
- Creating documents that require delivery.
- Creating and changing itineraries.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>fa</key>
          <value>در حین مهاجرت، عملیات زیر توصیه نمی‌شوند:
- تغییر تنظیمات انواع اطلاعات تماس برای شرکا و انبارها.
- ایجاد اسنادی که نیاز به تحویل دارند.
- ایجاد و تغییر مسیرها.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>ru</key>
          <value>Во время перехода не рекомендуется выполнять следующие операции:
- изменение настроек видов контактной информации партнеров и складов,
- создание документов, требующих доставки,
- создание и изменение заданий на перевозку.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>tr</key>
          <value>Geçiş sırasında şu işlemlerin yapılmaması önerilir: 
 - İş ortaklarının ve ambarların iletişim bilgisi türlerinin ayarlarının değiştirilmesi, 
 - Teslimat gerektiren belgelerin oluşturulması,
- Taşıma görevlerinin oluşturulması ve değiştirilmesi</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>it</key>
          <value>During migration, the following operations are not recommended:
- Changing settings of contact details kinds for partners and warehouses.
- Creating documents that require delivery.
- Creating and changing itineraries.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>pl</key>
          <value>During migration, the following operations are not recommended:
- Changing settings of contact details kinds for partners and warehouses.
- Creating documents that require delivery.
- Creating and changing itineraries.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>vi</key>
          <value>During migration, the following operations are not recommended:
- Changing settings of contact details kinds for partners and warehouses.
- Creating documents that require delivery.
- Creating and changing itineraries.</value>
        </title>
        <visible>true</visible>
        <enabled>true</enabled>
        <userVisible>
